window.products.push({"id":406039,"name":"Air Fryer Magnetic Cheat Sheet Set, Cook Times Chart Air Fryer Accessories Instant Pot Cheat Sheet, Magnet Sheet Quick Reference Guide for Cooking and","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TWhLJBa+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AIR FRYER ACCESSORIES: Each package comes with 2 air fryer cooking time memo sheets that show cooking time, temperature, and food size so you don't have to do any more cooking so you don't have to waste time looking up food. A thoughtful gift for all occasions. EXCELLENT PRODUCT QUALITY: I-MOGOO Air Fryer's induction memo sheet is made with durable materials to ensure daily use even in long-term use. It includes a large magnet (10.5 x 6.5 inches) and a small magnet (5 x 5 inches), so you can stack your favorite cookware without worrying about damage. And it can also be used as an insulating mat to protect your tabletop. You can also use it to hold your baking sheet, which is soft enough and easy to fold to hold things from any angle. EASY TO STICK AND READ: The Air Fryer's cooking time chart has a magnetic backing that allows you to easily stick it to your refrigerator or any other magnetic surface in your kitchen, and the lightweight, flexible kitchen conversion table will never peel off stickers/decals or leave a terrible residue. We use large, clear letters to make sure you can easily read them from any angle. If the cookware is not made of iron, a double-sided heat-resistant adhesive will help you stick it in place. GOOD CLASSIFICATION: I-MOGOO Air Fryer cooking memo list offers more than 100 of the most common foods, including (beef, chicken, pork, various vegetables, beans, various seafood, grains, etc.), which are correctly classified and labeled to ensure you can read them at a glance. WIDE COMPATIBILITY: We designed this air fryer recipe to be compatible with the Ninja Air Fryer, NINJA, INSTANT VORTEX, COSORI, ULTREAN Air Fryer, and any other air fryer on the market, so you can reduce your cooking effort and spend more time enjoying your meals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TWhLJBa+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"I-MOGOO","source_asin":"B094J8Q8G1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406039","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094J8Q8G1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094J8Q8G1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":406040,"name":"TOMENGBEIAABBCC Adorey and Ives White Chair Covers for Wedding, Party, Bridal Shower, Set of 2 Stretch Velvet Spandex Chair Cover","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+8XJt+nrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"An Extra Special Touch for a Perfect Day Planning your wedding day is a big deal. Organizing any major event is. When you’ve settled your guest list, venue, and photographer, it’s time to address the finer details, like decor. But, as you probably know, finer doesn’t mean less important. All those little embellishments add life to your event, but finding the right ones can take time and effort. We’ve taken the fuss out of choosing chair covers. If you want a slipcover that works with any color palette, that achieves elegance and comfort, and fits most chair and budgets, you’ve found it here. Bone-colored velvet materials stretches for a custom-like fit that won’t slip or bunch up. Simple back embellishment lends each chair a clean, classic style that works well with any theme. That means you don’t need any other chair adornments. Buy your wedding chair covers here and make your day one you’ll remember forever. More Than You Expected ●Easy to use ●Enhances any special event ●Soft velvet with classic criss cross detail ●High-quality material conceals most colors ●Adds elegance to your home dining room chairs too ●Elastic material with leg attachments form fits most chair types Is the material strong enough to fit over any sized chair? These slipcovers adorn most standard-sized chairs used for large gatherings. We recommend measuring your chair to ensure the size is right for you. Will they stay put all day? Stretch material clings to the chair to hold it securely in place for a custom-like fit. Minimal bunching will occur with normal use. Our Perfect-Fit Guarantee means we have you and your chairs covered. If you’re not satisfied with your purchase, let us know within 30 days and we’ll give you a full refund. So buy now risk free.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+8XJt+nrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adorey and Ives","source_asin":"B07Y42T7JF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y42T7JF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y42T7JF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
