window.products.push({"id":406181,"name":"LNM Weighted Blanket for Youth Kids Adult Cooling Cotton Summer Breathable Heavy Throw for Twin Queen King Bed Couch(48\"x72\" 12lbs for 100-140 lbs Gre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wS8zJqEsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"FABRIC: 100% organic cotton. Made the weighted blanket soft and breathable. Say goodbye to cheap glass and plastic bead fillings that feel like a “quilt of cornhole bags”. DO NOT sacrifice quality for price. HOW TO CHOOSE BLANKET WEIGHT: Please choose 7%-12% your body weight, 10%of your weight is the ideal choice. 5 lbs blanket for 30-60 lbs individual; 12 lbs blanket for 100-140 lbs individual; 15 lbs blanket for 130-190 lbs individual. If the final weight falls equally between two blanket sizes, it’s best to go with the lighter option. THE FINAL SOLUTION TO A FULL NIGHTS REST: We have a tendency to take our stress, problems, and worries with us to bed, making it difficult to get an uninterrupted, calming sleep. The weighted blanket offers great all-natural sleep help for adults and kids by offering the gentle sensation of being held to encourage deep, healthy, restful sleep. The extra weight blanket keeps you warm in cold days, and keeps you cold in summer. It is the perfect gift for weddings, birthdays, Mother’s Day, Father’s Day Christmas, graduations, or housewarmings, Back to school. For women, men, youth, teens, kids, girls and boys. NOTICE: 1.A weighted blanket is supposed to on the top of the mattress and should not go over the edges of bed. 2.when using with children or seniors, ensure the individual has enough strength to move the blanket off themselves if necessary. The weighted throw should NOT be used by children under 5 years old and pregnant women or by any individual that weighs less than 50 pounds. WASH INSTRUCTION: Weighted blanket can be washed on gentle settings, hand washed or dry cleaned. Tumble dry on low or hang to dry. Corner ties allow for use with a duvet cover for easy cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wS8zJqEsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LNM","source_asin":"B07QN3VSGB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QN3VSGB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QN3VSGB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":406182,"name":"Krups 985-71 Il Caffe Duomo Coffee and Espresso Machine, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TQBG8EK8L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Twice the brewing options, at half the price. On the left: a steam-pressurized espresso and cappuccino system with safety valve and a \"Perfect Froth\" attachment. On the right: an 8-cup coffee maker with stop-and-serve feature, nonstick warming plate and convenient swing-out filter holder. 16Hx23-1⁄3Wx13-3⁄4D. Amazon.com By combining a regular coffeemaker and espresso machine, this appliance makes it possible to satisfy every coffee craving with a single, compact unit. The espresso machine includes a steam nozzle with a frothing attachment for making coffee drinks like cappuccino and café latté. Make espresso the traditional way: tamp the proper amount of coffee into a filter basket inside a filter holder, twist the filter holder onto the machine, pour cold water into the machine's boiler, and flick the \"espresso\" switch. Brew up to 8 ounces of espresso into a glass carafe or directly into one or two espresso cups, (a two-cup adapter is included). Making regular coffee is just as easy: insert a paper filter into the swing-out filter basket, spoon in the desired amount of coffee, pour cold water into the coffeemaker's water chamber (separate from the espresso boiler), and flick the \"coffee\" switch. Brew up to eight 5- ounce cups of coffee in the 40-ounce, glass coffee carafe, which sits on a warming plate next to the espresso carafe. Removing the carafe from the warming plate pauses the brewing process for a midbrew pour. The appliance has a plastic exterior, measures 14 inches wide, 12 inches high, and 10 inches deep, and carries a one-year warranty against defects. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TQBG8EK8L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KRUPS","source_asin":"B00005NZD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00005NZD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00005NZD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
