window.products.push({"id":406269,"name":"Aston & Arden Tencel Lyocell Throw Blanket - Premium Eucalyptus and Cotton All Season Heavy Weight Soft and Cool Hotel Quality, 400 GSM Breathable for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810f8bYHcAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUSTAINABLE EUCALYPTUS & PREMIUM COTTON THROW BLANKET: These luxurious throws are made from 30% Eucalyptus Tencel Lyocell Fiber and 70% Premium ringspun Cotton. It is a brand name for a type of sustainable fiber made from Eucalyptus wood pulp. Premium ringspun cotton is produced by spinning long-staple cotton fibers into soft, durable yarns. For this collection we've blended these two fine yarns, eucalyptus Tencel Lyocell and premium ringspun cotton, to make these exceptional woven textiles. NATURALLY COOLING BLANKET: Premium Cotton and Eucalyptus blend absorbs moisture more efficiently than cotton alone. Its cooling effect offers restful relaxation while enhancing the quality of sleep. Tencel Lyocell Eucalyptus yarns produced by environmentally responsible processes create a superior fabric with a naturally silky soft handfeel. BLANKETS FOR A LUXURIOUS BEDROOM: Our blankets feature a sophisticated classic diamond weave design. Cocoon yourself in the stylish comfort of this 400 GSM heavyweight blanket and enjoy a restful and refreshing sleep. The Tencel Lyocell Eucalyptus yarn features include botanic origin, sustainable production, gentleness on skin, long-lasting softness and comfort. COLORS INSPIRED BY NATURE: A cosmopolitan collection of rich earthtones, including Sky Blue, Slate Grey, Driftwood Taupe, Seaside Teal, Cloud White, and Shell Grey. Make a bold decor statement in any room with an added layer of distinguished home textiles from this refined, all season color palette by Aston & Arden. ENVIRONMENTALLY RESPONSIBLE FABRICS: Enjoy peace of mind knowing that Tencel Lyocell fabrics are produced by environmentally responsible processes from the sustainably sourced natural eucalyptus wood, thus safeguarding resources for future generations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810f8bYHcAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aston & Arden","source_asin":"B0B7TNXNX6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7TNXNX6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7TNXNX6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
