window.products.push({"id":406359,"name":"CERAMIC CUTLERY SET WITH CUTTING BOARD, BLADES ZIRCONIUM OXIDE, Quality boxed for gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419KwS3HleL._AC_.jpg","description":"KNIVES HAVE a unique blade made of zirconium oxide, an advanced material that its hardness just less than the diamond. THIS SPECIAL BLADE will hold its edge much longer than steel, will never rust and won’t alter the look or taste of food. EASY CLEAN BY HAND, NO DISHWASHER.The knife is nonmagnetic completely. MADE OF compacted material and has ergonomic plastic handle , ergonomically shaped handle (ABS) in black which keep the ceramic knife lightweight and colorful, added TPR on handle feels much more comfortable while holding. PLEASE READ: INSTRUCTIONS FOR USE: It is ideal for straight cuts of fruits, vegetables and boneless meats.It always use with a plastic or wood cutting board. Avoid cutting on marble, stone, glass, or tile.Use your conventional steel knives for carving, prying, boning, and cutting frozen food and cheese. These applications involve twisting and flexing, which require a more flexible material than ceramic. Hand wash with water and liquid dish soap; do not wash in the dishwasher. For discolorations not removed by normal washing, wash the blade only with a mild bleach solution WHEN USING AVOID: Dropping on hard surfaces Hitting against china or flatware Putting the blade in open flame (ceramic conducts heat) Scraping hard surfaces Turning the blade on its side to smash garlic or other items Applying force to the side of the blade","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419KwS3HleL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perennial Essentials","source_asin":"B01F9TWA0E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406359","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F9TWA0E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F9TWA0E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
