window.products.push({"id":406573,"name":"truHugs King Size Weighted Blanket for Couples | 35 lbs | White | Cooling Weighted Blanket for Cuddling | Premium Quality Natural Cotton Heavy Sensory","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lbF8iDnjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Engineered from its very fibers: Enjoy truHugs DUO, a weighted blanket completely made from scratch with cotton and eucalyptus with the goal of producing a superior weighted blanket experience for 2 adults. Swaddle towards infinity: Balance the autonomic nervous systems of you and your partner with continuous deep pressure stimulation, an outcome ensured with DUO’s ability to continually stabilize pressure whether a couple is moving or asleep. Each DUO is weighted by the world’s first automated bead spreader, removing human error from the ‘weighting’ process completely. Nearly every other weighted blanket on the market spread their glass beads by hand, leaving some grids more empty or full. Cooling to start, warm at the finish: Generating gradual light warmth, DUO continually dissipates the excess heat generated by 2 adults...making cuddling time and sleep comfortably cool. DUO's core is studded with supple eucalyptus fibers, which naturally generate additional breathable warmth as the night gets colder. Not too heavy or light: How heavy your weighted blanket should be has nothing to do with whether you are hefty or thin, as all the pressure receptors in our skin are mostly the same! Rather, our recent scientific findings have shown us that different types of people may have varying levels of sensitivity to pressure. At 35 pounds, DUO is weighted to be heavy enough for most, while remaining light enough for the pressure sensitive. Adaptable to multiple bed frames: Specifically engineered for use by a couple on King or California King size beds.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lbF8iDnjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"truHugs","source_asin":"B07Y7YTWC7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406573","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y7YTWC7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y7YTWC7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
