window.products.push({"id":406583,"name":"Portable Camping Fan with LED Lantern, 10400mAh 9 inch Rechargeable Battery Operated Tent Fan, Quiet and Strong Wind, Hang Hook, Perfect Outdoor USB F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819ljuyWM4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【12-36 Hours Working Time】- With a massive 10400mAh battery capacity, our tent fan can last for up to 25 hours on a single charge, so you can stay cool and comfortable no matter where you are.In addition, it also supports working while charging, and does not generate heat during use, which is also safe for children. ✔【3S Fast Cooling, Low Noise】- Our camping fan features the latest brushless motor technology with high-performance ultra-thin fan blades for minimal noise (<30db) and an 80% increase in powerful airflow output. So you can enjoy restful, undisturbed sleep in your tent or RV. ✔【3 Level Brightness LED Light】- 2 in 1 travel fan with 3 levels of adjustable brightness, ideal for night camping or hiking. The lowest brightness gives a soft but not harsh glow, and the maximum brightness can easily illuminate the entire area. With it, there is no need to buy additional camping lanterns, making your hiking experience more convenient. ✔【10400mAh Mobile Power Bank】- Our 3-in-1 portable fan is powered by an advanced 10400mAh high-capacity rechargeable battery that is higher quality, safer, more reliable, and lasts longer. It has a USB-A port, which means it can be used as an emergency backup power source for your phone, flashlight, and laptop. Relieving your worries about battery life, it is one of the must-haves for outdoor travel. ✔【Hang Hook Design】- The bottom of the desk fan has a built-in Hook, you can hang it on tents, branches and other places you want, without taking up too much space. It comes with its own ultra- stable chassis to ensure smooth operation even at maximum wind speeds. ✔【Designed for Camping】- The overall size is small and exquisite, you can easily put it in your backpack when you are not using it, it will not bring you extra burden. It uses USB charging, which means you can connect it to your power bank, laptop or car power supply for charging. Supports 2A fast charging and only needs 6 hours to fully charge. It is an ideal companion for camping, fishing, and hiking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819ljuyWM4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JINLICTE","source_asin":"B0C135VRT1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406583","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C135VRT1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C135VRT1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
