window.products.push({"id":406595,"name":"Gourmia GMS9255 Mandoline Slicer & Cutting Board Set Kitchen Slicer & Food Prep Board Combo With 4 Interchangeable Blades & FREE Bonus Knife, Durable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yI9-BqgXL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Your trusty cutting board now performs double duty. Does your cooking require endless chopping, slicing and dicing? If so, the 2-in-1 Mandoline Slicer & Cutting Board Set by Gourmia serves as an ideal replacement for your various utensils and appliances. This multipurpose instrument features a cutting board and paring knife designed for every tough to delicate food prep task. Flip up the built-in mandoline, and the unit quickly transforms into a commercial quality slicer you can use at home. Pick from 4 different grating blades to make perfect portions of onion, meat, cheese, vegetables and much more. Want pro cuts, but don’t want to bother with an industrial grade machine? Keep mealtime simple with this kitchen essential. All-in-One Convenience With its unique convertible design, the piece lends a helping hand whether you need a sharp cutter, precise shredder, or just a simple surface for ingredient preparation. Keep it on hand for every occasion. Quality Cutting Board Safe, sturdy plastic material provides an extra large working area for you to manually cut fruits, veggies, meats and more. The nonporous surface won’t scratch or trap liquid like other wood models. Interchangeable Mandoline A self-contained slicing platform folds out and props atop the cutting board so you can go from manual to machine cutting. Slide in your desired plate for regular slicing, julienne, fine grating, or coarse grating. A Space-Saving Solution Enjoy a complex culinary tool that stores as simply and compactly as possible. The set’s blade accessories, bonus knife, and folding mandoline neatly pack into the board’s underneath compartment. Stress-Free Operation The unit’s various parts are all top rack dishwasher safe for effortless cleaning. Users also gain peace of mind with safety features like a hand guard, blade protectors, and nonslip materials.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yI9-BqgXL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gourmia","source_asin":"B01N0B688E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406595","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N0B688E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N0B688E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
