window.products.push({"id":406667,"name":"Noritake Crestwood Platinum 20-Piece Dinnerware Place Setting, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":269.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NYN1264YL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Crestwood Platinum is a fine, white porcelain china dinnerware pattern richly adorned with a wide etched platinum band. This is one of Noritake's most popular patterns and priced to fit into any budget. Simple and elegant, this timeless pattern will adapt to your ever changing lifestyle. Crestwood Platinum has an array of functional serving pieces and accent pieces to fit all of your home entertainment needs. This set contains four, five piece place settings of dinner plate, salad plate, bread and butter plate, cup and saucer. Amazon.com Noritake's emphatically formal Crestwood Platinum dinnerware creates a beautiful table year-round with classic materials and an ornate design. The pattern starts with a base of translucent white porcelain that is delicate in shape but durable enough for confident use. A broad band of platinum borders each piece. This accent features a softly frosted background etched with a gleaming pattern of tiny geometric borders and flowing, interwoven flourishes. Solid bands frame the design and two interior bands contribute an added touch of refinement. With 20 pieces in all, the set includes four place settings, each with a 10-1/2-inch dinner plate, an 8-1/4-inch salad/dessert plate, a 6-1/2-inch bread and butter plate, a 6-inch saucer, and a footed teacup. The teacup is especially lovely, with platinum accents on the foot, body, rim, and handle sides. All pieces are safe in the dishwasher. Crestwood is a full collection, so an expansive range of serveware and accessory pieces are also available to round out the look of your table. --Emily Bedard What's in the Box 4 place settings. Place setting includes: dinner plate; salad plate; bread and butter plate; saucer; teacup. 20 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NYN1264YL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Noritake","source_asin":"B0002PC7TA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002PC7TA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002PC7TA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
