window.products.push({"id":406692,"name":"Gravity Blanket Upgraded Cooling Weighted Blanket for Adults, 15 lbs Grey 48\"x 72\" Twin/Throw, Original Weighted Blanket, Cotton Made Blanket with Was","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":187.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BmQ2V2rrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TROUBLE SLEEPING?: Gravity Blankets offers the new Cooling Weighted Blanket! An OEKO-TEX Certified weighted blanket is made of thermoregulating eco-friendly fabrics that helps maximize breathability and airflow while the cover is made of cooling lyocell. Our Premium Cooling Blanket design features a revolutionary cooling fabric, optimized to wick away moisture and leave you feeling rejuvenated. HIGH-QUALITY DESIGN: Our revamped cover is now made from 100% premium cooling lyocell. Eucalyptus-derived and plant-based, lyocell is nature’s most advanced cooling material. While the interior of the Weighted Blanket is made of 100% cotton and fine-grade glass beads. Our upgraded zipper, button & tie fastening system helps the blanket stay inside the breathable duvet. Gridded stitching on the weighted inner ensures the glass beads remain uniformly distributed which helps you wind down. PERFECT SIZE: Our Cooling Blanket measures 48”x72”, providing a grounding experience for one user at a time. Use our Gravity Blanket weight chart below to find the perfect fit for this comfortable blanket. We recommended that you select one of our Weighted Blankets that’s about 10% of your body weight. We designed it in this throw blanket size to allow the weight to be evenly distributed over the user and because each user requires a weight specific to their body weight. CARE & LONG-LASTING: Our Breathable Duvet cover is machine washable while the internal blanket should be hand-washed only. To ensure your Blanket lasts, remove the cover before washing, and machine wash in cold water with similar colors. It is recommended to tumble dry on low and cool iron if needed. Not sure which Gravity Blanket to choose from? We offer our new Cooling Weighted Blanket in 15, 20, and 35lb options and in different colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BmQ2V2rrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gravity","source_asin":"B09LJPW2FC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406692","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LJPW2FC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LJPW2FC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":406693,"name":"4 Pcs Wooden Spoon,DanziX 8-Inch Cocktail Mixing Spoons Stirring Coffee Soup Iced Tea Used for Kitchen Cooking-Light Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vKApdQ9LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"VALUE PACKAGE:Include 4 pcs long handle spoons in two different width.Perfectly meet your various needs. MATERIAL:These spoons are made of high quality wood,smooth surface,comfortable for holding.Easy to clean. SIZE:These spoons come in two size:20*3cm/7.87*1.2in,20*1.2cm/7.87*0.47in.Simple for mixing,stirring and cooking. PRACTICAL:The handle will not be hot when mixing the heated food.Wooden tools will not scratch surfaces of cups,dishes and bowls. WIDE APPLICATION:Perfect for family,hotel,restaurant activities,like cooking,mixing salads and stirring hot soup.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vKApdQ9LL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DanziX","source_asin":"B08PKLT71G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406693","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08PKLT71G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08PKLT71G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":406694,"name":"Beeswax Food Wraps (3-Pack Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1b1jK2CZLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TIME TO USHER IN A NEW WAY TO STORE YOUR FOOD... WITH BEESWAX WRAPS! A safe and natural replacement for one-time use plastic.  With proper use and care, these reusable food wraps can last up to a year.  The self-adhesive nature of these wraps makes it easy to cover just about anything.  Each size boasts a different design to help you differentiate between the wraps. So, when you're pulling them out of the drawer you're not wondering which size is which design. Directions: Cover food or container with the wrap and apply light pressure. The simple warmth from your hands will create a seal. Made with the following: -Organic cotton -Natural beeswax -Natural tree resin -Organic jojoba oil Assorted Sizes: -Small (Green Plaid) – 8” x 8” / 20.5 cm x 20.5 cm -Medium (Bee Pattern) – 11” x 11” / 28 cm x 28 cm -Large (Blue Plaid) – 14” x 14” / 35.5 cm x 35.5 cm Care Instructions: -Wash before use -Use cool water and a soft, non-abrasive sponge -Use mild dish soap, if needed and do not wring -Pat off excess water -Air dry, fold and store away Note: Avoid the use of hot water or heat (microwave, oven, stove, and dishwasher) as this will melt the beeswax and compromise the efficacy of the food wrap. Package Contents: -3 assorted premium quality beeswax food wraps (1 small, 1 medium, 1 large) -1 reusable mesh organic cotton produce bag -2 pieces of twine -1 insert card *Each wrap is separated by a sheet of recyclable paper to ensure the wraps do not stick to each other during transit. **It is normal for your wraps to feel stiff upon opening since it depends on the temperature at which these wraps were stored as well as the method of transport used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1b1jK2CZLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J JOEN J JOEN","source_asin":"B07Z2ZWGX1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406694","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Z2ZWGX1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Z2ZWGX1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":406695,"name":"24 Pieces 4-Hour Blessing Incense Coil - 100% Natural - C004S-r1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VGpHo4lCS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This incense is made by the special formula of the Tibetan Buddhism. Most of raw materials are picked from the high-mountain herbs with the highest grade. The aroma is unique and pleasant. This exclusive incense formula has developed for over 20 years, which shows its excellent effects (help mind concentration) while in deep meditation. Ordinary price but high quality. Burning this incense may also improve the entire atmosphere of surroundings. We guarantee there is no extraction of incense essential oil before making this incense. Key ingredients are 100% natural. ***p.s. Please follow this link to tell how to separate 2 coils: https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/I/71g8O4DVuzL._SL1005_.jpg [If you receive broken items, please ask Amazon for replacement immediately.] **Key Ingredients:+Agalloch Eaglewood (10%)+White Sandalwood (5%)+Nard (20%)+Moly (20%)+Acronychia pedunculata (10%)+Lysimachia (20%)+Asarum (2%)+several Tibetan Dharma medicines and nectars (3%)+Machilus zuihensis Hayata powder (10%)**Please note:--If you feel too smokey while burning this incense, please open window to keep the air circulation.--For those who got used to perfumed incense with strong scent, you may not be able to feel this fully natural fragrance. We suggest to fresh your nose for a few days (in order to recover olfactory senses) before burning this incense.--For supporting environmental protection, some of our incense boxes are recycled used in order to reduce waste.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VGpHo4lCS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bosen Incense","source_asin":"B004XZHTWA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406695","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004XZHTWA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004XZHTWA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
