window.products.push({"id":406941,"name":"DANGTOP Cooling Blankets with Double Sided Cold, Ultra Cool Summer Blanket for Hot Sleepers All Season Queen Size Breathable Bed Blanket Q-Max 0.4 Pol","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QFdCQrDiS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Double Layer Double-Cold - Our cooling blankets use the double-sided cool design - Use A-side with Q-Max cold value >0.4 in summer to keep your skin cool and not sweat even in hot summer. Use B-side with cool in spring/autumn which is more comfortable to take away the residual heat from your body and enjoy a good night's sleep. Coldest Cooling Material - Polyethylene is the best cooling material, which content in our summer cooling blankets is as high as 35%, Q-Max is much greater than 0.4, more than twice the cooling effect of common blankets. Keeping body temperatures as low as 3 degrees keeps you cool and comfortable, even at night in the hottest season. All Seasons Are Useful - A-side is made of Polyethylene and Nylon combination, which can quickly evaporate the heat generated by the body and transfer cool air to the surface of the body, perfect for sultry days. B-side is made of 100% cool fiber material, soft and skin-friendly, suitable for everyone. You can take it with you on any occasion: couch, picnic, plane or train ride. Breathable & Comfortable - The high-quality cool feeling material of the blanket makes the blanket has an ice silky touch. Perfectly fits the body, reduces body temperature, and ensures that the body does not wake up all sticky and sweaty. Good breathability can transfer the hot and humid air inside the blanket to the outside of the blanket effectively so that you have a comfortable sleep all night. DANGTOP focuses on making COLDER and COLDER COOLING BLANKETS, as the largest bamboo cooling blankets on Amazon, we have rich experience. Can be machine washed or hand washed, recommended to use a laundry bag and gentle mode for machine washing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QFdCQrDiS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DANGTOP","source_asin":"B091KX37FT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406941","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091KX37FT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091KX37FT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
