window.products.push({"id":406988,"name":"Pink Dragonfly Dreams 4pc Twin Bedding set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kEuqQ7cjL._AC_.jpg","description":"Train Your Dog from Barking, Walking, Leash Training, Sitting, Aggression, and Other Behavioral Obedience with Premium Dog Training Shock Collar! Would you like your puppy to behave, obey to simple commands and stop using barking as a response to every single stimuli? This is most effective, professional remote controlled, behavior correction anti-bark dog training collar is bound to meet all your demands! Make it yours now and become a true dog trainer yourself using high quality tool. 4 Modes of Safety training will help you provide your pets with enough behavior, teaching them how to behave in a very short period of time. Combine Static shock, Vibration And Beeping Sound To Create The Perfect Training Method For Your Little Buddy This durable obedience dog training collar will provide you with countless possibilities to control your dog from distance. You can pick among 100 shock levels and 100 vibration levels, combine them with the distinctive beeping sound and find what works best for your dog. Moreover, no matter what your dog’s breed, size or hunting dog , this Corrective training e-collar will provide unmatched comfort. All you have to do is adjust the remote control collar’s length. Train Indoor Or Outdoor This top notch pet trainer electronic shock collar comes with a handy rechargeable remote control. The 330 yard perimeter range allows you to practice in your backyard or at the park. In addition, the waterproof construction and the LCD display with the blue back light will give you the chance to use it during rain or during night-time. There are no limits for you and your furry friend! Package Contents and Accessories: 1 x Transmitter 1 x Receiver 1 x Nylon Strap 1 x Charging Cable 1 x Charging Adapter 1 x Test Bulb 3 x Sets of Contact Points Do Not Waste Time And Place Your Order Now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kEuqQ7cjL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SirGawain","source_asin":"B000V5O6J0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000V5O6J0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000V5O6J0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":406989,"name":"GLASSIQUE CADEAU Vintage Art Deco Lowball Gatsby Cocktail Glasses | Set of 4 | 13 oz Double Old Fashioned Tumblers for Drinking Classic Whiskey, Gin, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b69RzUfYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GIGGLE WATER READY – party like it’s the 1920s! Measuring 13 oz to the rim, these vintage Art Deco style lowball glasses are exclusively shaped for classic whiskey, rye, bourbon and gin based cocktails such as Old Fashioned, Whiskey Sour, Negroni and Sazerac. And how, they are also perfect for swell contemporary bar drinks such as White Russian, Margarita, Mint Julep, Caipirinha, Mai Thai, Pisco Sour. WELCOME TO SPEAKEASY – life is too short to have boring cocktails! Blown from the finest crystal glass, these seamless geometric glasses with curvy ribbed lines hit retro charm on all sixes. Graceful short cylinders are easy to hold in flappers’ and gent’s hands while durable enough for quick dishwasher cleanup RITZY GIFT – every set of four double old fashioned cocktail glasses comes neatly packed in our signature Great Gatsby-inspired gift box. The back of the box shares a few of our favorite classic lowball cocktail recipes for having a roaring good time! Perfect gift idea for Christmas, birthday, housewarming, retirement, wedding, and anniversary. BEE’S KNEES OF A BOX – our elegant gift box can also be used as an ideal rocks cocktail glasses storage case. The silky-smooth shape matching cloth carefully secures each piece of lowballer glassware in place and protects from dust, scratching, and breaking. Pack, tuck away, and save the precious space in your bar and kitchen HANDBLOWN BERRIES – all our crystal barware glasses are hand-blown. Due to this artisanal nature, their imperfections, nuances, or non-uniformity, such as a few tiny bubbles, are considered a characteristic of their value and authenticity. They do not affect the quality or sturdiness of these beautiful glasses.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81b69RzUfYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLASSIQUE CADEAU","source_asin":"B09TTN368H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-406989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TTN368H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TTN368H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
